WEBVTT

01:43.280 --> 01:44.240
Lin Yingtao!

01:45.360 --> 01:47.120
Why'd you come down here by yourself?

01:49.600 --> 01:51.120
I'm asking you.

01:51.160 --> 01:52.780
I didn't feel like walking with him.

01:52.820 --> 01:53.780
Who?

01:54.300 --> 01:56.280
No one. Doesn't matter anymore.

01:56.320 --> 01:57.740
Why so upset if they doesn't matter?

01:58.540 --> 01:59.500
Who was it?

02:04.000 --> 02:04.900
Fine.

02:04.940 --> 02:06.500
I'll call Jiang Qiaoxi,

02:06.540 --> 02:08.660
- have him come cheer you up.
- Why would you call him?

02:09.460 --> 02:11.160
This has nothing to do with him.

02:13.960 --> 02:14.980
Tell me.

02:15.020 --> 02:15.900
What did Jiang Qiaoxi do?

02:23.200 --> 02:24.660
She won't even answer my calls.

02:25.600 --> 02:26.980
Jiang Qiaoxi, what did you do?

02:27.540 --> 02:28.500
Nothing.

02:29.280 --> 02:30.300
Did she say

02:30.340 --> 02:31.300
where she wants to go?

02:31.920 --> 02:33.300
- Jiang Qiaoxi!
- Nope.

02:34.520 --> 02:35.480
Jiang Qiaoxi.

02:36.100 --> 02:37.120
Sorry, Jiang Qiaoxi.

02:37.160 --> 02:38.880
I didn't know you hadn't told Lin Qile

02:38.920 --> 02:39.820
about going abroad.

02:39.860 --> 02:41.180
You're going abroad?

02:41.820 --> 02:42.660
Why haven't we heard?

02:42.700 --> 02:44.200
Does Yingtao know?

02:44.240 --> 02:45.720
You didn't tell her either?

02:46.780 --> 02:47.900
How did Feng Letian know?

02:48.900 --> 02:50.040
So Yingtao had to

02:50.080 --> 02:52.740
hear it from Feng Letian
that you're going abroad?

02:52.780 --> 02:54.800
I only heard about it
in the teacher's office.

02:55.800 --> 02:57.200
Jiang Qiaoxi, do you…

02:58.560 --> 03:00.660
Do you even know
what Yingtao's biggest fear is?

03:12.100 --> 03:13.060
Sorry.

03:25.040 --> 03:26.280
Whatever he's dealing with,

03:26.320 --> 03:27.740
it's not my business.

03:28.340 --> 03:30.120
If he didn't want to tell me, that's fine.

03:30.160 --> 03:31.040
It's not like

03:31.080 --> 03:32.260
I'm not used to it.

03:33.780 --> 03:35.160
He's always been like this.

03:36.060 --> 03:37.300
To me, he's just…

03:38.560 --> 03:39.420
A dinner guest

03:39.460 --> 03:41.020
who comes over sometimes.

03:42.600 --> 03:43.740
At school,

03:43.780 --> 03:45.160
he's just a classmate.

03:45.200 --> 03:46.280
At home,

03:46.320 --> 03:47.280
just a neighbor.

03:48.860 --> 03:49.820
Is that so?

03:54.240 --> 03:55.260
Maybe.

03:55.920 --> 03:57.920
Maybe that's how Jiang Qiaoxi sees it.

03:57.960 --> 03:59.680
But I know that's not how you feel.

04:01.060 --> 04:02.580
It is how I feel.

04:02.620 --> 04:03.920
I'm very clear about it.

04:04.540 --> 04:06.100
My relationship with him

04:06.140 --> 04:08.240
is no different than I am with you all.

04:09.360 --> 04:11.560
If that's true,
then what are you so mad about?

04:11.600 --> 04:13.720
He didn't tell me either, and look at me.

04:13.760 --> 04:15.140
Do I look upset?

04:22.560 --> 04:23.400
‪Hey, you!

04:24.940 --> 04:25.940
Where are you going?

04:40.660 --> 04:41.620
Hello?

04:44.860 --> 04:46.260
Yeah, he's with us.

04:52.940 --> 04:54.040
Got it.

04:59.000 --> 04:59.960
Qin Yeyun says

05:00.600 --> 05:01.800
Yingtao's marching over here,

05:01.840 --> 05:02.800
and she's fired up.

05:04.360 --> 05:06.300
Told us three to get ready
to play peacemaker.

05:07.060 --> 05:08.800
I'm not getting involved.

05:09.500 --> 05:10.620
Let him deal with it.

05:11.120 --> 05:12.400
Don't worry.

05:12.440 --> 05:14.260
I'll probably be able to stop her.

05:19.000 --> 05:20.120
Jiang Qiaoxi!

05:36.040 --> 05:37.420
Didn't you say

05:37.460 --> 05:38.780
we'd get food after school?

05:39.420 --> 05:40.380
I'm starving.

05:47.860 --> 05:48.900
Me too.

06:04.820 --> 06:05.820
You guys hungry?

06:06.360 --> 06:07.740
Let's call Qin Yeyun and go together.

06:11.740 --> 06:12.700
Let's go.

06:22.140 --> 06:23.340
Told you,

06:23.380 --> 06:25.060
Yingtao's not the type to hold a grudge.

06:25.100 --> 06:26.260
She's not even mad.

06:27.760 --> 06:28.720
- Du Shang,
- Hm?

06:29.880 --> 06:31.280
you're still too naive.

06:38.500 --> 06:39.760
Here you go, gorgeous.

06:40.660 --> 06:42.120
- Thanks.
- No problem.

06:42.160 --> 06:43.380
Here.

06:43.420 --> 06:44.840
Wings and beef.

06:44.880 --> 06:46.080
Thanks. Dig in.

06:46.120 --> 06:48.540
AUTHENTIC CHANGSHA STINKY TOFU

06:48.580 --> 06:50.200
Want some?

06:50.240 --> 06:51.680
You have it. I'll eat crispy gizzards.

06:53.760 --> 06:54.840
I will have it.

06:58.920 --> 06:59.960
Think the beef overseas

07:00.780 --> 07:02.760
is better than ours?

07:06.600 --> 07:07.440
Not bad.

07:12.880 --> 07:13.900
Then here, try this.

07:13.940 --> 07:15.220
Smashed cucumber.

07:17.000 --> 07:18.020
Once you're abroad,

07:18.060 --> 07:20.200
bet you won't get much of this stuff

07:20.240 --> 07:21.080
anymore.

07:27.100 --> 07:28.060
Yingtao,

07:29.060 --> 07:30.200
I know you're mad at me.

07:30.240 --> 07:31.360
I'm not.

07:35.720 --> 07:37.660
If I were you, I'd be mad too.

07:37.700 --> 07:39.300
- But that's not…
- If you knew I'd be mad,

07:39.340 --> 07:40.400
why did you do it?

07:47.720 --> 07:50.060
Jiang Qiaoxi didn't tell us either.

07:50.780 --> 07:52.340
- Right?
- I didn't know anything.

07:52.380 --> 07:53.240
- You knew?
- Nope.

07:53.280 --> 07:54.480
Never heard about it.

07:54.520 --> 07:55.480
Yeah, none of us did.

08:07.660 --> 08:08.620
Exactly.

08:09.840 --> 08:10.940
You've been walking around,

08:11.520 --> 08:12.900
not thinking about anything.

08:14.040 --> 08:14.980
But you already had

08:15.020 --> 08:15.980
everything planned out.

08:16.860 --> 08:19.340
You just didn't tell us, right?

08:20.220 --> 08:22.280
- That's not…
- Same as you quitting the Olympiad.

08:22.320 --> 08:23.340
Quitting everything.

08:23.960 --> 08:25.100
You never said a word.

08:25.700 --> 08:27.160
And that's fine, I get it.

08:27.200 --> 08:29.280
But now you're leaving the country,
and we only find out

08:29.320 --> 08:30.420
from someone else?

08:32.220 --> 08:33.720
Do you know what that means to me?

08:34.299 --> 08:36.020
It means, to you,

08:36.059 --> 08:36.900
we don't matter at all.

08:37.840 --> 08:39.720
You've got your own life mapped out.

08:39.760 --> 08:40.700
So many ideas.

08:40.740 --> 08:41.720
So many plans.

08:42.299 --> 08:44.140
And I really thought you needed me…

08:45.840 --> 08:46.940
need our support.

08:50.940 --> 08:51.780
Turns out,

08:51.820 --> 08:53.120
with or without us,

08:53.160 --> 08:55.000
you're still Jiang Qiaoxi.

08:57.300 --> 08:58.260
And without you,

08:59.160 --> 09:00.900
I'm still Lin Yingtao.

09:01.580 --> 09:02.800
Du Shang is still Du Shang.

09:04.040 --> 09:05.000
Right?

09:11.800 --> 09:12.780
Come on. Eat.

09:14.380 --> 09:15.340
Eat up.

09:18.680 --> 09:19.640
Eat.

09:35.120 --> 09:36.080
Excuse me, how much?

09:36.640 --> 09:37.600
121 yuan.

09:43.840 --> 09:44.800
Yingtao.

09:53.200 --> 09:57.080
WONTONS, CRISPY FLATBREAD

09:59.020 --> 09:59.980
Yingtao.

10:01.560 --> 10:02.520
Yingtao.

10:03.600 --> 10:04.560
Yingtao.

10:10.140 --> 10:11.100
Let me finish.

10:16.080 --> 10:17.720
Go on then. Say it.

10:25.740 --> 10:27.160
Studying abroad

10:27.200 --> 10:28.700
is something I've wanted for a long time.

10:30.580 --> 10:31.820
I'd already made that decision

10:33.760 --> 10:35.040
back in Qunshan.

10:35.820 --> 10:36.940
And it's not

10:37.560 --> 10:38.820
going to change.

10:40.180 --> 10:42.020
So you made that decision back in Qunshan?

10:43.420 --> 10:45.860
Jiang Qiaoxi, you kept your big plan

10:45.900 --> 10:47.480
from me for eight years?

10:48.300 --> 10:49.880
For eight years, you had countless chances

10:49.920 --> 10:50.880
to tell me, yet…

10:51.540 --> 10:53.300
You came to my house
for dinner all the time.

10:53.340 --> 10:54.420
Ate so many jujube buns

10:54.460 --> 10:55.400
and stuffed lotus roots.

10:55.440 --> 10:56.440
And you never said a word?

10:57.080 --> 10:58.120
My parents were really

10:58.160 --> 10:59.140
worried about you.

10:59.680 --> 11:01.460
My dad, he barely even talks.

11:01.500 --> 11:03.200
But he tried so hard to comfort you.

11:03.240 --> 11:04.400
And you said nothing.

11:04.440 --> 11:05.460
You kept it from him.

11:05.500 --> 11:06.480
He's never even

11:06.520 --> 11:08.320
said those things to me.

11:08.360 --> 11:09.420
You lied to us.

11:09.460 --> 11:11.000
You see my entire family as a joke.

11:11.040 --> 11:12.320
- Right?
- You'll come with me.

11:13.580 --> 11:14.640
Three years.

11:15.500 --> 11:16.640
Two, if I can do it quick.

11:19.780 --> 11:21.220
I'll take you with me.

11:21.920 --> 11:24.100
Everything after 17 years old

11:25.620 --> 11:26.700
is so far away.

11:28.280 --> 11:30.040
Like some fantasy, Jiang Qiaoxi.

11:35.140 --> 11:37.840
- You serious?
- I'm serious.

11:56.020 --> 11:59.220
So you didn't mean to keep it from me?

12:00.900 --> 12:03.060
It is not meant for me to
be the last one to know it?

12:06.080 --> 12:07.300
You really wanted me…

12:09.900 --> 12:11.140
to go with you?

12:13.500 --> 12:14.460
Do you…

12:16.720 --> 12:18.300
want me to stay?

12:59.840 --> 13:00.820
You should go.

13:07.320 --> 13:08.520
Will you come with me?

13:11.000 --> 13:11.960
I…

13:12.940 --> 13:14.720
never really thought about it.

13:25.860 --> 13:27.480
But no matter how I think about it,

13:30.680 --> 13:31.640
my path…

13:34.500 --> 13:35.720
just doesn't go that way.

13:40.840 --> 13:41.800
But you, Jiang Qiaoxi…

13:43.200 --> 13:44.400
you're meant to fly.

13:45.480 --> 13:47.140
And you're gonna fly high.

13:47.180 --> 13:48.220
Fly far away.

14:00.200 --> 14:01.340
No matter where I end up,

14:04.520 --> 14:05.720
you have to come see me.

14:08.480 --> 14:09.620
I'll come get you, I promise.

14:11.140 --> 14:12.380
We're only gonna be apart

14:13.060 --> 14:14.220
for a little while.

14:15.300 --> 14:16.260
Just a little while.

14:21.760 --> 14:22.880
Not even a little tempted?

14:24.740 --> 14:27.420
Of course I want to be with him.

14:28.360 --> 14:29.320
But

14:30.740 --> 14:32.480
he's got his stuff to take care of.

14:33.320 --> 14:35.040
I've got mine.

14:37.740 --> 14:38.700
And

14:40.580 --> 14:41.540
I know

14:41.580 --> 14:42.700
he's scared too.

14:43.280 --> 14:44.840
But if he is going abroad for the future,

14:44.880 --> 14:45.920
what about you two?

14:47.480 --> 14:48.440
Anyway,

14:49.000 --> 14:50.980
he told me how he feels.

14:51.520 --> 14:53.680
I told him how I feel.

14:56.040 --> 14:57.560
I don't know about the future.

14:58.080 --> 14:59.260
But we'll figure out.

15:00.920 --> 15:01.960
You're amazing.

15:02.620 --> 15:04.380
If that's what you've decided, focus on

15:04.420 --> 15:05.680
the college entrance exam.

15:05.720 --> 15:07.820
You don't have as many options as he does.

15:08.640 --> 15:11.040
Honestly, I don't think
he has that many options.

15:23.820 --> 15:24.720
Yingtao!

15:49.860 --> 15:51.240
I peeled this for you.

16:12.240 --> 16:15.960
FROM DONGSHI ROAD, ROUTE 25 IN SERVICE

16:24.860 --> 16:25.820
What?

16:28.580 --> 16:30.460
- English vocabulary?
- Right.

16:32.500 --> 16:33.900
- Wanna listen?
- Nope.

16:33.940 --> 16:34.900
- Come on, listen.
- Nope.

16:42.880 --> 16:44.220
…at what value of E,

16:44.260 --> 16:46.300
can M just lift off the ground?

16:46.340 --> 16:47.560
So really,

16:48.200 --> 16:50.440
it's about figuring out

16:50.480 --> 16:53.420
when the force from AB equals MG.

16:54.280 --> 16:55.300
Once we find

16:55.340 --> 16:57.720
the equations for MG and F,

16:57.760 --> 16:59.500
we just plug them into I and that's it.

17:00.640 --> 17:01.760
Look at the question.

17:03.740 --> 17:05.599
See, here's the formula it gives..

17:49.040 --> 17:52.380
JIALIN CITY POWER CONSTRUCTION
HOUSING COMPOUND

18:04.600 --> 18:05.820
The other day

18:06.640 --> 18:07.600
I saw something

18:07.640 --> 18:08.680
on my QQ feed.

18:09.600 --> 18:10.920
It said youth

18:11.440 --> 18:12.840
is like a roll of toilet paper.

18:12.880 --> 18:14.520
Looks like a lot,

18:15.420 --> 18:16.420
but once you start using it,

18:17.380 --> 18:18.220
it runs out fast.

18:18.800 --> 18:19.840
So

18:19.880 --> 18:21.440
while there's still a bit left,

18:21.480 --> 18:23.060
figure out how you wanna waste it.

18:23.840 --> 18:24.800
School starts soon.

18:24.840 --> 18:26.280
No more chances in Year 12.

18:30.460 --> 18:31.860
Whatever.

18:34.440 --> 18:35.960
That doesn't sound like you, Lin Yingtao.

18:36.600 --> 18:38.280
What's wrong? In a bad mood?

18:42.040 --> 18:43.620
Jiang Qiaoxi again?

18:45.960 --> 18:47.100
No.

18:52.880 --> 18:55.240
He's heading to Hong Kong
to take the TOEFL exam.

18:55.840 --> 18:57.020
This time,

18:57.700 --> 18:59.100
he probably won't come back.

19:00.040 --> 19:01.500
Who said he's not coming back?

19:01.540 --> 19:02.900
Come on, of course he's not.

19:03.500 --> 19:05.120
Academic Proficiency Test
ended a while ago.

19:05.160 --> 19:06.320
He should've left

19:06.960 --> 19:08.100
a long time ago.

19:08.140 --> 19:11.340
If he wasn't coming back,
he wouldn't be looking to rent a place.

19:11.880 --> 19:12.760
He's renting a place?

19:14.000 --> 19:14.960
You didn't know?

19:15.620 --> 19:16.720
He's looking for a place.

19:18.420 --> 19:20.320
He was looking at those rental ads

19:20.360 --> 19:22.060
outside my house the other day.

19:22.100 --> 19:23.680
He told Dad and Auntie Shuangyan

19:23.720 --> 19:25.280
to let him know if they see anything.

19:25.960 --> 19:27.580
Why's he renting?

19:28.580 --> 19:30.640
He's not staying at home?

19:31.220 --> 19:33.640
I think his mom's
giving him a hard time again.

19:34.420 --> 19:36.460
Honestly, I don't think
he can stay there anymore.

19:37.440 --> 19:40.140
But he still wants
to stick around for a while for you.

19:50.140 --> 19:52.040
I should've known staying meant

19:52.660 --> 19:54.560
he'd have to deal with all that.

19:55.680 --> 19:56.540
Here.

19:57.600 --> 19:59.140
The vermicelli pot's warm, right?

19:59.180 --> 20:00.060
Is the fire lit?

20:00.100 --> 20:02.220
- I'll take this one.
- Yeah, it's going.

20:03.040 --> 20:04.780
It's ready. Let me try it.

20:06.520 --> 20:07.660
It's good, still warm.

20:09.040 --> 20:10.000
Guys.

20:10.660 --> 20:12.220
You know why I asked you here today?

20:12.760 --> 20:14.540
Because there's something I wanna ask.

20:15.560 --> 20:16.780
I was thinking

20:16.820 --> 20:19.080
shall we visit Qunshan some time?

20:20.780 --> 20:21.640
Back to Qunshan?

20:23.000 --> 20:24.740
That whole area's been torn down.

20:24.780 --> 20:25.860
Bet we wouldn't recognize it.

20:25.900 --> 20:27.560
Not the school though.

20:27.600 --> 20:30.020
I heard Qunshan Elementary's
still standing,

20:30.060 --> 20:31.200
just no students.

20:32.880 --> 20:34.600
Let's go then, if we want.

20:34.640 --> 20:36.000
I've been wanting to go back.

20:37.040 --> 20:38.020
Let's go.

20:38.060 --> 20:39.200
Now there's a train line too.

20:39.240 --> 20:40.280
Two hours and we're there.

20:40.320 --> 20:41.980
We leave early, be back by nightfall.

20:42.020 --> 20:43.140
Back to Qunshan!

20:43.880 --> 20:44.920
Cai Fangyuan?

20:46.020 --> 20:46.880
Back to Qunshan.

20:46.920 --> 20:48.080
Back to Qunshan!

20:48.120 --> 20:49.040
Back to Qunshan!

20:49.080 --> 20:50.960
- Let's do it.
- Back to Qunshan!

20:51.000 --> 20:53.600
Back to Qunshan!

20:59.340 --> 21:00.380
We're here.

21:00.420 --> 21:01.820
QUNSHAN NORTH STATION

21:06.360 --> 21:07.620
We're home.

21:07.660 --> 21:08.740
- Home.
- Let's go.

21:08.780 --> 21:09.740
Come on.

21:12.300 --> 21:13.260
Recognize it?

21:14.140 --> 21:15.260
Remember here?

21:15.300 --> 21:16.860
I bet you do, Cai Fangyuan.

21:16.900 --> 21:17.820
Uncle Cai chased you

21:17.860 --> 21:19.320
all the way from the arcade

21:19.360 --> 21:20.320
back to the site

21:20.360 --> 21:21.720
with a slipper in his hand.

21:22.420 --> 21:23.760
Lin Yingtao,

21:23.800 --> 21:25.300
bold of you to even bring that up.

21:25.340 --> 21:26.180
I know it was you

21:26.220 --> 21:27.820
who ratted me out to my dad.

21:27.860 --> 21:29.720
Well, whose fault is that?

21:29.760 --> 21:31.240
You took Jiang Qiaoxi to the arcade,

21:31.280 --> 21:32.260
You slacked off

21:32.300 --> 21:33.300
and dragged him down.

21:34.200 --> 21:35.320
Lin Yingtao,

21:35.360 --> 21:37.280
don't put Jiang Qiaoxi on a pedestal.

21:37.320 --> 21:38.400
You didn't see him. He was

21:38.440 --> 21:39.480
having the time of his life.

21:39.520 --> 21:41.020
Jiang Qiaoxi, go on, tell them.

21:42.240 --> 21:43.540
All because you guys

21:43.580 --> 21:45.260
suck at King of Fighters '97.

21:46.140 --> 21:47.080
I even let you pick

21:47.120 --> 21:47.980
Iori Yagami, and you

21:48.020 --> 21:49.080
still couldn't beat me.

21:49.120 --> 21:50.540
What are you talking about?

21:50.580 --> 21:51.800
Iori was my main.

21:51.840 --> 21:53.420
My moves were smooth as silk.
No way I lost.

21:53.460 --> 21:55.120
- You're misremembering for sure.
- Hey,

21:55.160 --> 21:56.360
I remember it clearly.

21:56.400 --> 21:57.440
Jiang Qiaoxi always

21:57.480 --> 21:58.520
opened on defense.

21:58.560 --> 22:00.020
Then started with full-on attack.

22:00.060 --> 22:01.440
He crushed us.

22:01.480 --> 22:02.480
Nothing we could do.

22:02.520 --> 22:03.720
That explains it.

22:03.760 --> 22:05.060
Playing dirty, huh?

22:05.100 --> 22:06.280
Shady tactics.

22:09.140 --> 22:10.800
Geng Xiaoqing!

22:12.540 --> 22:14.220
What are you doing here?
When did you get back?

22:15.080 --> 22:17.140
Who's that? She's gorgeous.

22:17.180 --> 22:18.180
Geng Xiaoqing,

22:18.220 --> 22:20.240
we were seatmates
in junior high back in Qunshan.

22:20.940 --> 22:21.920
Hi, I'm Geng Xiaoqing.

22:21.960 --> 22:23.120
Nice to meet you guys.

22:23.740 --> 22:25.300
I almost didn't recognize you.

22:25.340 --> 22:26.660
Took a few looks.

22:26.700 --> 22:28.580
You've changed so much.

22:29.760 --> 22:31.460
I haven't changed that much, have I?

22:31.500 --> 22:32.920
Still the same old me.

22:32.960 --> 22:34.260
It's not like I've been away

22:34.300 --> 22:35.420
from Qunshan that long.

22:35.460 --> 22:36.720
I'm not talking about your looks.

22:36.760 --> 22:38.300
I mean your whole vibe.

22:38.340 --> 22:39.720
There you were, laughing so hard

22:39.760 --> 22:40.700
and talking so much.

22:40.740 --> 22:42.120
I thought I had the wrong person.

22:42.160 --> 22:43.480
Seriously, who even are you?

22:43.520 --> 22:44.940
Hey,

22:44.980 --> 22:46.360
you might've got the wrong person.

22:46.400 --> 22:47.920
Doesn't talk, doesn't laugh.

22:47.960 --> 22:49.440
That can't be Lin Qile.

22:50.460 --> 22:52.460
Six-Eared Macaque,
Take a hit from my golden cudgel!

22:53.000 --> 22:55.300
What even is that, Cai Fangyuan?

22:55.340 --> 22:57.060
You're literally everywhere.

22:57.100 --> 22:58.200
Can you shut up for once?

22:59.220 --> 23:00.320
Hurry up, let's go!

23:20.580 --> 23:22.800
Let me help you.

23:25.560 --> 23:26.420
Okay. Up you go.

23:26.460 --> 23:27.820
Careful.

23:27.860 --> 23:29.140
What are you all doing?

23:29.180 --> 23:30.620
No no no, slow down!

23:30.660 --> 23:31.560
Oh my god.

23:32.840 --> 23:33.880
Almost there.

23:37.080 --> 23:38.640
Hang in there, Yingtao.

23:38.680 --> 23:39.520
Hold on.

23:40.160 --> 23:41.120
Come on.

23:41.160 --> 23:42.260
Quick, let's go.

23:43.160 --> 23:44.720
Come back here!

23:46.080 --> 23:47.040
Be careful.

23:49.600 --> 23:50.560
Three, two, one.

23:55.200 --> 23:56.380
Jiang Qiaoxi!

24:57.880 --> 25:00.880
YU QIAO STREET

25:11.360 --> 25:14.300
CAI FANGYUAN STREET

25:27.500 --> 25:30.340
QIN YEYUN STREET

25:41.760 --> 25:44.480
DU SHANG STREET

25:44.520 --> 25:46.380
We're all back together…

25:46.420 --> 25:50.300
At the Qunshan construction site…

25:54.340 --> 25:57.000
Jiang Qiaoxi is home…

25:58.440 --> 25:59.640
Lin Yingtao…

25:59.680 --> 26:01.380
I'm back…

26:03.460 --> 26:04.920
Catch me.

26:04.960 --> 26:06.440
I'm stepping on Cai Fangyuan first.

26:07.820 --> 26:08.960
Careful, slow down.

26:09.000 --> 26:10.120
Help me out.

26:10.160 --> 26:11.460
You got my shadow.

26:11.960 --> 26:13.500
I got your shadow again.

26:18.820 --> 26:19.800
This hill

26:20.480 --> 26:21.680
used to feel so tall.

26:22.240 --> 26:23.320
So hard to climb.

26:23.360 --> 26:24.640
But now

26:25.300 --> 26:26.260
not so much.

26:28.240 --> 26:29.220
Everything's changed.

26:29.980 --> 26:31.080
Guess

26:31.120 --> 26:32.660
we've all come a long way.

26:32.700 --> 26:34.320
Kind of makes me sad, thinking about it.

26:34.360 --> 26:36.020
You're such a sap sometimes.

26:36.060 --> 26:37.120
You big softie.

26:37.840 --> 26:40.080
It only hurts when things stay the same
and people changed.

26:40.120 --> 26:41.100
Look at us.

26:41.140 --> 26:42.720
Things changed, but we didn't.

26:42.760 --> 26:44.800
Our bond is stronger than ever.
That's worth celebrating.

26:44.840 --> 26:45.780
Got it?

27:09.840 --> 27:11.880
Jiang. Qiao. Xi.

27:12.880 --> 27:14.280
You look good.

27:17.000 --> 27:17.960
You too.

27:28.760 --> 27:30.700
So are you just gonna keep staring at me?

27:33.160 --> 27:34.840
I meant the sunset.

27:38.800 --> 27:40.580
If you stare at sunsets long enough,

27:41.980 --> 27:43.160
you'll see

27:45.100 --> 27:46.160
they disappear

27:46.740 --> 27:47.960
in the blink of an eye.

27:50.860 --> 27:52.180
That's not true.

27:52.220 --> 27:53.440
They're not going away.

27:54.440 --> 27:55.760
They're just on their way back.

27:58.120 --> 28:00.240
Next time we see them,

28:00.280 --> 28:01.700
they'll be the light of dawn.

28:02.820 --> 28:03.780
Yingtao…

28:07.200 --> 28:08.300
I know why…

28:10.820 --> 28:12.320
you wanted to come back to Qunshan.

28:15.220 --> 28:16.080
Actually,

28:16.120 --> 28:17.800
I can stay a bit longer.

28:24.380 --> 28:25.340
You…

28:28.800 --> 28:30.800
You really are such a homebody.

28:45.800 --> 28:46.760
Yingtao…

28:49.020 --> 28:50.340
aren't you scared?

28:50.880 --> 28:51.840
You once told me

28:52.340 --> 28:53.860
your biggest wish growing up

28:53.900 --> 28:55.900
was that none of us
would ever drift apart.

28:59.060 --> 29:00.280
But now…

29:02.860 --> 29:04.780
I'm the one leaving again.

29:11.320 --> 29:12.280
This time,

29:13.920 --> 29:16.100
I didn't see your leaving as goodbye.

29:17.500 --> 29:18.940
The moment you walk out of home,

29:19.520 --> 29:20.700
I'll think of it as you starting

29:20.740 --> 29:21.700
your journey back home.

29:22.660 --> 29:23.800
So Jiang Qiaoxi,

29:25.240 --> 29:26.800
can you promise me…

29:29.020 --> 29:29.980
and promise Chunlu…

29:33.980 --> 29:35.460
you'll find your way back home soon?

29:41.380 --> 29:42.520
Come home?

29:43.220 --> 29:44.320
Come home.

29:47.040 --> 29:48.000
Okay.

29:51.040 --> 29:52.000
I promise you.

29:53.600 --> 29:54.560
I promise Chunlu.

29:56.400 --> 29:57.820
I'll come home soon.

30:13.040 --> 30:13.900
Lin Yingtao,

30:14.560 --> 30:16.760
sometimes I think you're kind of dumb.

30:17.640 --> 30:19.200
Excuse me? Why would you say that?

30:19.760 --> 30:21.820
I ranked 18th in class this time.

30:24.440 --> 30:26.380
That kind of dumb
has nothing to do with grades.

30:29.240 --> 30:30.380
Then what is it?

30:32.580 --> 30:33.540
It's from the heart.

30:34.460 --> 30:36.260
Jiang Qiaoxi's leaving tomorrow.

30:36.300 --> 30:38.380
And you didn't even try to keep him here.

30:38.900 --> 30:39.920
That's your goodbye?

30:44.020 --> 30:45.160
He's leaving.

30:46.100 --> 30:47.560
And he's feeling terrible about it.

30:49.020 --> 30:51.040
I don't want to make it harder for him.

30:51.580 --> 30:52.740
What about your feelings?

30:55.560 --> 30:57.400
He's leaving tomorrow

30:57.440 --> 30:58.520
and you're not even gonna cry?

30:59.300 --> 31:00.260
What are you doing?

31:05.680 --> 31:06.720
Instead of thinking

31:07.640 --> 31:09.040
he's leaving tomorrow,

31:09.860 --> 31:11.800
I'd rather tell myself

31:11.840 --> 31:13.060
we have one more day together.

31:13.940 --> 31:16.040
One more day with him
is one more happy day.

31:16.760 --> 31:18.520
So I don't wanna cry in front of him.

31:18.560 --> 31:19.960
And that's not dumb?

31:33.100 --> 31:35.020
- Hello?
- Hey, Yingtao?

31:35.060 --> 31:36.680
I'm outside your place.

31:36.720 --> 31:38.580
Can you come down for a second?

31:40.360 --> 31:41.320
Who was that?

31:46.120 --> 31:47.480
You enjoy your foot bath.

31:47.520 --> 31:48.480
I'm going out.

31:52.920 --> 31:54.000
Jiang Qiaoxi.

32:02.840 --> 32:03.800
What is it?

32:05.560 --> 32:06.520
Something for you.

32:07.420 --> 32:08.380
For me?

32:09.060 --> 32:10.020
What is it?

32:11.020 --> 32:11.900
Go on, open it.

32:13.740 --> 32:15.540
Why'd you spend money on this?

32:16.860 --> 32:18.000
My cousin's wife

32:18.040 --> 32:19.860
helped me pick the gift in Hong Kong.

32:19.900 --> 32:21.100
I paid with my own money.

32:21.140 --> 32:22.620
From my Olympiad prize.

32:22.660 --> 32:23.740
I'll buy what I want.

32:26.480 --> 32:27.440
Take it.

32:33.400 --> 32:34.580
Heels?

32:39.400 --> 32:40.540
Are they the right size?

32:41.540 --> 32:43.400
How did you know my size?

32:44.180 --> 32:46.280
I peeked at your shoe rack the other day.

32:46.840 --> 32:48.000
Pretty sure it's right.

33:03.440 --> 33:04.520
Do they fit?

33:06.040 --> 33:07.000
Perfect fit.

33:17.700 --> 33:18.800
Careful.

33:23.660 --> 33:24.780
Watch it.

33:29.560 --> 33:31.000
I can walk in heels now!

33:36.740 --> 33:37.860
Jiang Qiaoxi.

33:41.060 --> 33:42.080
Look.

33:42.120 --> 33:43.380
Now that I'm wearing these,

33:43.420 --> 33:44.380
we're of the same height.

33:46.460 --> 33:47.540
They're pretty.

33:52.040 --> 33:53.060
This is for you.

33:53.640 --> 33:54.640
Lipstick?

33:54.680 --> 33:56.100
Wanna try it on?

33:58.720 --> 34:00.500
What's with you today?

34:00.540 --> 34:02.540
Heels and lipstick?

34:06.640 --> 34:08.159
My cousin's wife said

34:10.400 --> 34:12.380
the first time she wore heels

34:12.960 --> 34:14.320
and put on lipstick,

34:15.580 --> 34:16.820
that's when she realized

34:17.920 --> 34:19.020
she'd grown up.

34:27.080 --> 34:27.920
Yingtao,

34:28.960 --> 34:30.159
I…

34:30.199 --> 34:32.219
might not be there for your 18th birthday.

34:34.480 --> 34:36.320
But I don't want to miss

34:37.060 --> 34:38.580
the moment you become an adult.

34:43.880 --> 34:45.139
What about boys?

34:47.600 --> 34:50.080
When do boys feel like they've grown up?

34:50.840 --> 34:51.860
What about you?

34:52.699 --> 34:53.940
When did you feel like

34:53.980 --> 34:55.580
you became an adult?

34:58.900 --> 34:59.860
Me?

35:09.620 --> 35:10.860
Probably every time

35:11.720 --> 35:13.540
I didn't have a choice.

35:23.280 --> 35:24.240
Jiang Qiaoxi.

35:25.960 --> 35:27.000
Don't be like this.

35:28.840 --> 35:29.900
At the time like this,

35:30.780 --> 35:32.080
we should stay cheerful.

35:33.560 --> 35:36.320
This isn't a farewell,
that we won't see each other again, right?

35:36.360 --> 35:38.680
So let's be cheerful, be happy.

35:40.540 --> 35:41.400
Happy.

35:44.800 --> 35:46.060
Yingtao,

35:46.960 --> 35:47.920
actually,

35:48.800 --> 35:50.920
it's not just because
of what my cousin's wife said

35:51.620 --> 35:53.760
that I bought you heels and lipstick.

35:53.800 --> 35:55.500
I've always felt

35:55.540 --> 35:57.140
if you ever put on heels,

35:57.180 --> 35:58.240
wore lipstick,

35:58.280 --> 36:00.020
you'd look stunning.

36:01.700 --> 36:03.440
And I wanted to be the first to see it.

36:09.600 --> 36:10.860
Put it on for me?

36:10.900 --> 36:12.100
I can't see myself.

36:22.320 --> 36:23.740
Okay, let me try.

36:46.660 --> 36:47.740
Is it nice?

36:49.580 --> 36:50.500
You look amazing.

36:50.540 --> 36:52.240
Did you do it outside lip lines?

36:53.360 --> 36:54.200
No.

36:57.000 --> 36:58.260
You look really, really good.

37:07.960 --> 37:09.460
Heels and lipstick

37:09.500 --> 37:10.800
might be fun,

37:11.980 --> 37:13.300
but Lin Yingtao,

37:13.340 --> 37:14.340
aren't you scared?

37:16.820 --> 37:17.800
Scared of what?

37:18.980 --> 37:20.560
He says all this sweet stuff,

37:20.600 --> 37:21.660
and then he's leaving.

37:21.700 --> 37:23.500
You don't know what's ahead.

37:24.080 --> 37:25.720
And still, you gave your heart away.

37:25.760 --> 37:26.720
You're not scared?

37:28.700 --> 37:29.680
I am.

37:31.940 --> 37:34.180
But it's something I'm scared of
and still want to do.

37:42.320 --> 37:44.540
Sometimes I wish I could be like you.

37:44.580 --> 37:46.480
Brave enough to be dumb, just once.

37:46.520 --> 37:49.720
I told you, I'm not dumb.

37:51.560 --> 37:53.820
Not dumb? Then why'd you smack me?

37:53.860 --> 37:55.000
I have

37:56.040 --> 37:56.920
a broken palm line.

37:59.520 --> 38:00.660
Then hit me back.

38:00.700 --> 38:02.960
Equal and opposite reaction, right?

38:13.780 --> 38:14.740
Give me that.

38:17.600 --> 38:18.780
‪-Wait.
‪-Thanks.

38:19.400 --> 38:20.980
How'd you know I was gonna put it there?

38:29.120 --> 38:30.080
Done.

38:37.940 --> 38:39.580
It's late. You're still reading?

38:40.160 --> 38:42.100
I want to finish the last chapter.

38:43.220 --> 38:44.340
How's it end?

38:45.740 --> 38:48.240
Of course it ends well.

38:50.720 --> 38:52.420
Yu Qiao said we're not going

38:52.460 --> 38:53.460
to see him off tomorrow.

38:53.500 --> 38:54.620
You'll go by yourself.

38:54.660 --> 38:55.660
We figured we'd give you

38:55.700 --> 38:57.320
all of Jiang Qiaoxi's last moments.

38:57.980 --> 38:59.660
What do you mean, "last moments"?

39:00.960 --> 39:03.220
Jiang Qiaoxi and I will

39:03.260 --> 39:05.120
share lots of moments in the future.

39:05.820 --> 39:06.960
He'll come back soon.

39:07.860 --> 39:09.380
He'll have his own life,

39:09.420 --> 39:10.920
and I'll have mine.

39:11.460 --> 39:12.360
You know this for sure?

39:12.400 --> 39:13.520
I just do.

39:15.980 --> 39:16.880
Yeah, yeah.

39:16.920 --> 39:17.860
You two will

39:17.900 --> 39:19.060
share plenty of moments soon.

39:19.700 --> 39:21.360
It is us who don't want to see him off.

39:21.400 --> 39:22.520
We're just lazy, okay?

39:37.400 --> 39:38.420
Thank you all.

39:54.600 --> 39:55.620
I finished the last part

39:55.660 --> 39:56.680
of Harry Potter.

39:56.720 --> 39:58.540
Wanna hear me tell the ending,

39:58.580 --> 40:00.300
like I used to?

40:01.920 --> 40:03.200
Does it end happily?

40:05.000 --> 40:06.180
In the end,

40:06.220 --> 40:08.460
Harry defeats Voldemort.

40:08.500 --> 40:10.400
Good beats evil.

40:10.440 --> 40:12.480
Light beats darkness.

40:12.520 --> 40:13.520
Love

40:13.560 --> 40:14.520
beats hatred.

40:24.120 --> 40:25.460
INTERNATIONAL, HONG KONG,
MACAU, TAIWAN DEPARTURES, GATE 2

40:31.740 --> 40:32.860
Then what?

40:33.560 --> 40:34.560
Then

40:34.600 --> 40:36.380
Harry becomes an Auror.

40:36.420 --> 40:37.380
Still best friends

40:37.420 --> 40:38.700
with Ron and Hermione.

40:38.740 --> 40:40.380
He marries Ginny.

40:40.420 --> 40:42.360
They are a happy family,

40:42.400 --> 40:43.760
with three kids.

40:44.540 --> 40:46.740
They are off to Hogwarts and
Harry sees them off.

41:11.360 --> 41:12.480
He's so lucky.

41:15.280 --> 41:16.540
Yeah.

41:16.580 --> 41:17.560
His scar

41:17.600 --> 41:19.720
hasn't hurt in 19 years.

41:31.060 --> 41:32.140
Everything's peaceful now.

41:33.180 --> 41:34.320
That's the ending.

41:38.040 --> 41:39.340
I'm back.

41:39.380 --> 41:40.360
Yingtao.

41:41.320 --> 41:42.380
Hi, Uncle.

41:43.720 --> 41:44.720
"Hi, Uncle"?

41:46.760 --> 41:48.020
Don't tell me you forgot me.

41:49.040 --> 41:49.880
Mr. Wang,

41:49.920 --> 41:51.340
all the gifts have been delivered.

41:51.920 --> 41:54.040
Got it.
Thanks, Zhang. Wait for me outside.

41:54.080 --> 41:55.120
Okay, Mr. Wang.

41:55.660 --> 41:57.500
- Uncle Wang.
- That's me.

41:57.540 --> 41:58.780
- Uncle Wang!
- It's me!

41:59.500 --> 42:00.620
Now you remember.

42:01.300 --> 42:02.440
Your Uncle Wang happened to

42:02.480 --> 42:03.520
be back visiting family.

42:03.560 --> 42:05.380
And he came just to see you today.

42:06.040 --> 42:06.900
Little Yingtao,

42:06.940 --> 42:08.440
you didn't even recognize me.

42:08.480 --> 42:10.040
You're gonna break my heart.

42:10.640 --> 42:11.680
No,

42:11.720 --> 42:12.760
I…

42:12.800 --> 42:14.460
Look how tall I've gotten.

42:15.160 --> 42:17.040
Even if we passed each other
on the street,

42:17.080 --> 42:18.800
you probably wouldn't recognize me either.

42:22.640 --> 42:24.080
- Ay…
- Heehee.

42:29.600 --> 42:31.000
Yingtao,

42:31.040 --> 42:33.080
is Qiaoxi's cousin picking him up
at the airport?

42:34.880 --> 42:35.840
He is.

42:38.380 --> 42:41.140
Don't worry,
he knows Hong Kong pretty well.

42:41.180 --> 42:42.740
Everything's set.

42:42.780 --> 42:44.040
Everything's fine.

42:44.560 --> 42:46.000
I'm just worried about you.

42:46.040 --> 42:47.240
You okay?

42:50.280 --> 42:51.300
I'm good. Really.

42:53.280 --> 42:54.480
Jiang Qiaoxi's off

42:54.520 --> 42:55.840
to do something amazing.

42:56.340 --> 42:58.720
I'm happy for him.

43:03.640 --> 43:04.960
Oof.

43:05.000 --> 43:05.880
Hey, senior,

43:06.420 --> 43:09.120
you better come visit me more often.

43:09.160 --> 43:10.900
- Okay.
- And you.

43:12.520 --> 43:14.200
We'll all come see you.

43:15.120 --> 43:16.080
Yingtao.

43:17.080 --> 43:19.520
Take care of yourself.

43:19.560 --> 43:20.500
Stay happy.

43:25.200 --> 43:26.460
Happiness and peace for everyone.

43:26.500 --> 43:27.340
- Uncle Wang.
- Careful.

43:35.080 --> 43:38.500
- A cow on a mountaintop.
- A cow on a mountaintop.

43:38.540 --> 43:41.480
- Two horns and one big head.
- Two horns and one big head.

44:12.660 --> 44:13.620
Yingtao,

44:14.200 --> 44:15.460
study hard in college.

44:16.900 --> 44:19.080
If you ever need anything, just call me.

44:20.000 --> 44:22.520
I see you as my good friend.

44:23.400 --> 44:25.020
You are also like a daughter to me.

44:26.480 --> 44:27.980
- Senior.
- Yeah?

44:28.020 --> 44:30.080
Let's meet up often.

44:30.120 --> 44:31.800
Call often.

44:32.940 --> 44:34.340
At this point in life,

44:35.040 --> 44:37.080
there aren't many buddies you can truly…

44:39.420 --> 44:40.660
speak your mind with.

44:42.980 --> 44:44.060
Let's keep in touch.

44:44.560 --> 44:46.600
I'm one of your buddies too, Uncle Wang.

44:49.460 --> 44:50.560
You…really.

44:50.600 --> 44:51.800
- Heh…
- Alright.

44:52.880 --> 44:53.880
Alright.

44:55.400 --> 44:56.660
Count me in.

44:57.560 --> 44:58.680
Buddies.

44:58.720 --> 44:59.820
Buddies.

47:14.900 --> 47:17.840
Subtitle translation by: Jiaxin Wang
